infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Two scopes of pending
  desc isPending tracks one action from its owner; useFormStatus tracks the enclosing form from any child
  compares
    - label isPending — from useActionState
      children
        - label Lives with the form owner
          desc Read in the same component that calls useActionState
        - label Tracks this one action
          desc True from submit until the action settles
        - label React-owned boolean
          desc Not a hand-rolled isSubmitting that leaks on early return
        - label Reaches children by prop
          desc Must be passed down to wire a child button
    - label useFormStatus — from react-dom
      children
        - label Lives below the form
          desc A child component rendered inside the form element
        - label Tracks the nearest form
          desc Returns pending plus the in-flight FormData
        - label No prop-drilling
          desc A shared SubmitButton reads it with zero wiring
        - label Silent false if misplaced
          desc Called beside the form, pending stays false and nothing errors
theme
  palette #6366f1 #f43f5e
